      "writtenOn": "2021-01-05T16:13:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a Nuvoton specific define and shouldn\u0027t be used in config.h.  Add a check in the NPCX code to verify NPCX_LCT_SUPPORT is present if is defined. \nSimilar to https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/1b696564/chip/npcx/system-npcx7.c#78",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5962,
        "startChar": 37,
