        "id": 1394446
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-06T08:53:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After removing NPCX_LCT_SUPPORT, it becomes some kind of guard for NPCX7.\nIf someone enables hibernate PSL \u0026 RTC function for NPCX7, it will show the error message because NPCX7 doesn\u0027t support LCT. However, \u0027cheza\u0027 use NPCX7 \u0026 its config hibernate PSL \u0026 RTC.\nTam, could we disable the RTC or hibernate PSL function for cheza?",
      "parentUuid": "42c9dbeb_018d17ad",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5962,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 5962,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "4e5c6428faa2f8dcb9be780976b74e88cc4a3a54",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
